233
00:14:28,501 --> 00:14:35,500
This independent money-making game became the prototype for all slot machines for the next 70 years.

234
00:14:35,501 --> 00:14:40,500
When the lever was pulled, it caused drums on the slot machine to spin.

235
00:14:40,501 --> 00:14:45,500
On the side of the drums were discs with a series of round holes.

236
00:14:45,501 --> 00:14:49,500
These holes corresponded with the payout symbols on the three reels.

237
00:14:49,501 --> 00:14:53,500
Adjacent to the discs were vertical payout levers.

238
00:14:53,501 --> 00:14:54,397
